                                free when the concept has none)
  help [command]                display help for command
"
`;

exports[`CLI surface > help > help: gangtise alternative concept-info 1`] = `
"Usage: gangtise alternative concept-info [options]

Concept profile: definition, investment logic, industry space, competitive
landscape (50 credits/call)

Options:
  --concept-id <id>  Concept (theme index) ID, e.g. 121000130 机器人; discover via
                     'gangtise reference concept-search'
  --full             Also return catalyst events (keyEvents) via the v1 endpoint
                     — 500 credits/call instead of 50
  --format <format>  Output format (default: "json")
  --output <path>
  -h, --help         display help for command
"
`;

exports[`CLI surface > help > help: gangtise alternative concept-securities 1`] = `
"Usage: gangtise alternative concept-securities [options]

