                           gangtiseIndustry direction code (122000xxx:
                           macro/strategy/fixed-income/quant/overseas).
                           swIndustry (104xx0000) returns 0 here (default: [])
  --security <code>        Security code (default: [])
  --institution <id>       Institution ID (default: [])
  --category <name>        Conference category:
                           earningsCall/strategyMeeting/fundRoadshow/shareholdersMeeting/maMeeting/specialMeeting/companyAnalysis/industryAnalysis/other
                           (default: [])
